---
system: sys-01-identity-household-access
flow_id: logout
surface: mobile
spec_anchor: /software/systems/01-identity-household-access#post-v1authlogout
actors: [ParentApp, Gateway, IdentityService, PostgreSQL]
apis:
  - POST /v1/auth/logout
externals: []
queues: []
failure_paths:
  - token_already_revoked
  - network_partition
idempotency: idempotent — repeated logout returns 200
retry: caller-side single retry on network_partition; no retry on 4xx
timeout: 2s p99
status: final
---
%% HAND-CURATED.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant ParentApp
    participant Gateway
    participant IdentityService
    participant PostgreSQL

    Note over ParentApp,IdentityService: Entry point: parent_settings → Logout tap

    ParentApp->>Gateway: POST /v1/auth/logout {refresh_token} + Authorization: Bearer {access_token}
    Gateway->>Gateway: extract jti from access_token; validate signature
    Gateway->>IdentityService: forward request with jti + refresh_token
    alt network_partition
        Gateway-->>ParentApp: 503 network_partition (caller retries once with jitter)
        Note over ParentApp: ParentApp clears local auth.store optimistically on network_partition
    else token_already_revoked (idempotent path)
        IdentityService-->>Gateway: 200 already_revoked
        Gateway-->>ParentApp: 200
    else success
        IdentityService->>PostgreSQL: DELETE FROM refresh_tokens WHERE token_hash = hash(refresh_token)
        PostgreSQL-->>IdentityService: deleted (1 row or 0 if already absent)
        IdentityService->>PostgreSQL: UPDATE parent_sessions SET revoked_at=now() WHERE jti = {jti}
        PostgreSQL-->>IdentityService: updated
        IdentityService-->>Gateway: 200 {logged_out: true}
        Gateway-->>ParentApp: 200
        ParentApp->>ParentApp: clear auth.store (access_token, refresh_token, session metadata)
    end

    Note over ParentApp,IdentityService: timeout 2s p99 — server-side: hard DELETE refresh_tokens, soft revoked_at on parent_sessions
